return ['domain'=>'zinn-connector','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'yo','project-id-version'=>'zinn-connector','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-02T10:27:13+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-02T10:27:13+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Connector'=>'Zinn® Connector','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-connector'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-connector','Connects this WordPress site to Zinn Digital® so scheduled articles can be published to it. Paste a pairing code from your Zinn® dashboard and the plugin sets up its own credential — nothing is copied by hand.'=>'Ó so ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù WordPress yìí pọ̀ mọ́ Zinn Digital® kí a lè tẹ àwọn àpilẹ̀kọ tí a ti ṣètò jáde sí i. Lẹ àkóòdù ìsopọ̀ kan láti inú dásíbọ́ọ̀dù Zinn® rẹ kí ohun-ìtìsọ́kẹ́kẹ́ (plugin) náà sì lè ṣètò ẹ̀rí ìdánimọ̀ ti ara rẹ̀ — a kò ṣe ẹ̀dà ohunkóhun pẹ̀lú ọwọ́.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'A ti fi pamọ́. Tẹ iye tuntun kan lati rọ́pò rẹ̀.','Filter this list…'=>'Ṣe àlẹmọ́ àtòjọ yìí…','Filter this list'=>'Ṣe àlẹmọ àkójọ yìí','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Kò sí ohun tó bá àlẹ̀mọ́ yẹn mu.','Add a row'=>'Fi àtòlẹ́sẹẹsẹ kan kún un','Remove this row'=>'Yọ ìlà yìí kúrò','Remove'=>'Yọ kuro','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — àkópọ̀','Overview'=>'Akopọ','Copied'=>'Ti daakọ','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Gbogbo àfikún Zinn® lórí ojúlé yìí, àti bóyá ó ń ṣiṣẹ́.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Kò sí ìsopọ̀ tí a nílò fún àfikún yìí.','Open settings'=>'Ṣí àwọn ètò','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'O ko ni aṣẹ lati yi awọn eto wọnyi pada.','Settings sections'=>'Àwọn abala ètò','Support'=>'Ìrànwọ́','Save changes'=>'Fi àwọn àyípadà pamọ́','Tools'=>'Àwọn Irinṣẹ́','Export settings'=>'Gbe àwọn ètò jáde','Reset to defaults'=>'Tunto si aiyipada','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Èyí yóò mú gbogbo ètò lórí àfikún yìí padà sí àkùkọ rẹ̀. Ṣé kí a tẹ̀síwájú?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Ayẹwo fun atilẹyin','Import a settings file'=>'Kó fáìlì ètò wọlé','Import'=>'Gbégbọle','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Àwọn fáìlì tí a gbéjáde kì í ní àwọn ọ̀rọ̀-ìgbaniwọlé, àwọn tókẹ̀nì tàbí àwọn kókóro API nínú rárá — ẹ ó ní láti tún wọn tẹ̀ síbẹ̀ lórí ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù tuntun náà.','Settings saved.'=>'A ti fi àwọn ètò pamọ́.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Gbogbo ètò lórí ohun àfikún yìí ti padà sí ti àbáláyé.','Done.'=>'Ti parí.','That action is not available.'=>'Iṣe yẹn kò sí.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'Kò le ka fáìlì yẹn. Yan fáìlì ètò tí a mú jáde láti inú àfikún Zinn®.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Fáìlì yẹn tóbi jù láti jẹ́ àgbéwọlé ètò.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Fáìlì yẹn kì í ṣe àgbékalẹ̀ àwọn ètò Zinn®.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'Fáìlì yẹn jẹ́ èyí tí a kó jáde láti inú ohun-èlò àfikún mìíràn (%s), nítorí náà mímú un wọlé síhìn-ín yóò fi àwọn ètò tí ohun-èlò àfikún yìí kò lóye pamọ́.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'Àwọn ètò %d ti di wíwọlé. Àwọn ọ̀rọ̀-ìgbaniwọlé àti àwọn kọ́kọ́rọ́ API kì í sí nínú àkójọ ìjáde rárá, nítorí náà ẹ tún wọn tẹ̀ síbẹ̀.','The archive would be %1$d MB, over the %2$d MB limit set on this site. Raise the limit, or exclude some folders, on the Zinn Digital® → Connector → Backups screen.'=>'Àkójọ-pamọ́ náà yóò jẹ́ %1$d MB, èyí tí ó kọjá ààlà %2$d MB tí a ṣètò lórí ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí. Ṣe àlékún ààlà náà, tàbí yọ àwọn àpò-ìwé kan kúrò, lórí ojú-ìbòjú Zinn Digital® → Connector → Backups.','This site\'s PHP cannot create archives, so a backup could not be made.'=>'PHP ti ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí kò lè ṣẹ̀dá àwọn àpamọ́, nítorí náà a kò lè ṣe àwòkọ ìpamọ́ kan.','Could not create a temporary file.'=>'Kò lè ṣẹ̀dá fáìlì ìgbàdíẹ̀.','This site\'s files could not be archived.'=>'Àwọn fáìlì ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí kò ṣeé fi pamọ́ sínú àkójọpọ̀.','This site\'s PHP cannot compress archives, so a backup could not be made.'=>'PHP ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí kò lè fún àwọn àpamọ́ pọ̀, nítorí náà a kò lè ṣe àwárí afẹ́yìntì.','A backup of this site needs about %1$s of temporary space and only %2$s is free, so it was not attempted.'=>'Àwárí afẹ́lẹ́jẹ́ ti ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí nílò bíi %1$s ti àyè fún ìgbà díẹ̀ àti pé %2$s péré ló wà láìlò, nítorí náà a kò gbìyànjú rẹ̀.','This WordPress user cannot publish posts, so a connection made now could not publish either. Sign in as a user who can, and try again.'=>'Olùlò WordPress yìí kò lè tẹ àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ jáde, nítorí náà ìsopọ̀ tí a ṣe báyìí kò ní lè tẹ̀wé jáde bákan náà. Wọlé gẹ́gẹ́ bí olùlò tí ó lè ṣe bẹ́ẹ̀, kí o sì tún gbìyànjú.','Application passwords are turned off on this site, so we cannot create a credential. Ask your host to enable them, or connect the site with a password you create yourself in your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'A ti pa àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ìgbaniwọlé ohun-èlò lórí ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí, nítorí náà a kò lè dá ẹ̀rí ìdánimọ̀ kan sílẹ̀. Bẹ olùgbàlejò rẹ láti mú wọn ṣiṣẹ́, tàbí kí o so ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù náà pọ̀ pẹ̀lú ọ̀rọ̀ìgbaniwọlé tí o fúnra rẹ dá nínú dáṣíbọ́ọ̀dù Zinn Digital® rẹ.','WordPress would not create a credential for this site. Nothing has been sent anywhere.'=>'WordPress kò ṣẹda iwe-ẹri kan fun aaye yii. Kò si ohun ti a firanṣẹ si ibikibi.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this site. Nothing was connected, and the credential we made has been removed. Check the site can make outgoing requests, and try again.'=>'A kò lè kàn sí Zinn Digital® láti orí ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí. Kò sí ohun tí a so pọ̀, bẹ́ẹ̀ sì ni a ti yọ ẹ̀rí ìdánimọ̀ tí a dá kúrò. Ṣe àyẹ̀wò bóyá ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù náà lè ṣe àwọn ìbéèrè tí ń jáde, kí o sì tún gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi.','Zinn Digital® could not finish connecting this site. The problem is on our side, not with your pairing code — nothing was connected, and the credential we made has been removed. The same pairing code still works: try again in a few minutes.'=>'Zinn Digital® kò le pari sisopọ aaye yii. Iṣoro naa wa lati ẹgbẹ wa, kii ṣe pẹlu koodu isopọ rẹ — ko si ohun ti a sopọ, ati pe a ti yọ iwe-ẹri ti a ṣe kuro. Koodu isopọ kanna ṣi n ṣiṣẹ: gbiyanju lẹẹkansi ni iṣẹju diẹ.','Zinn Digital® did not accept that pairing code. Nothing was connected. Generate a fresh code in your dashboard and try again.'=>'Zinn Digital® kò gba koodu isopọ yẹn. Kò sí ohun tí a so pọ̀. Ṣẹ̀dá koodu tuntun kan nínú daṣibọọdu rẹ kí o sì tún gbìyànjú.','Connected. Zinn Digital® can now publish to this site.'=>'Ti sopọ. Zinn Digital® le ṣe atẹjade si aaye yii bayi.','Connected'=>'Ti so pọ̀','Connecting…'=>'Ń sopọ̀…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'Ti sopọ, ṣùgbọ́n ohun kan nílò àfiyèsí','Not connected'=>'A kò so pọ̀','Running on your own account'=>'Nṣiṣẹ lori akọọlẹ ti ara rẹ','We could not check this'=>'A kò lè ṣàyẹ̀wò èyí','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Àfikún yìí kò sọ ìdí. Fi ìròyìn àyẹ̀wò ránṣẹ́ a ó sì yẹ̀ ẹ́ wò.','Connection status'=>'Ipò ìsopọ̀','Last checked %s ago.'=>'A yẹ ẹ wò kẹ́yìn ní %s sẹ́yìn.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(ó ń ṣí sí táàbù tuntun)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'Firanṣẹ eyi si atilẹyin Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Èyí gangan ni ohun tí a ó fi ránṣẹ́ — kò sí ohun mìíràn, kò sì sí ohun tí a fi pamọ́. Àwọn ọ̀rọ̀-ìgbaniwọlé, àwọn tókẹ̀nì àti àwọn kọ́kọ́rọ́ API rẹ kò sí nínú rẹ̀.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Iroyin iwadii aisan ti yoo ranṣẹ','Copy to clipboard'=>'Ṣe àwòkọ sí pátákó ìpamọ́','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Fi ìròyìn yìí ránṣẹ́ sí àtìlẹ́yìn Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'A máa ń ṣí tíkẹ́ẹ̀tì ìrànlọ́wọ́ fún yín, a sì máa ń fèsì nípasẹ̀ e-meeli. Tí ẹ kò bá fẹ́ fi ránṣẹ́, ẹ da kọ láti òkè kí ẹ sì lẹ̀ mọ́ inú tíkẹ́ẹ̀tì fúnra yín.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'A kò le dé ọ̀dọ̀ Zinn Digital® láti orí olupin yìí (%s). Ṣe ẹ̀dà ìjábọ̀ tí ó wà lókè yìí kí o sì ṣí tikẹ́ẹ̀tì dípò rẹ̀ — kò sí ohun tí ó bàjẹ́ nínú àwọn ètò rẹ.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'A ti fi ránṣẹ́. Ẹ̀ka ìrànwọ́ Zinn® ti gba ìròyìn rẹ, wọn yóò sì fèsì nípasẹ̀ e-meeli.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'A ti fi ránṣẹ́. Ẹ̀ka ìrànwọ́ Zinn® ti gba ìròyìn rẹ — ìtọ́kasí %s — wọn yóò sì fèsì nípasẹ̀ imeeli.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'O ti fi ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ ìròyìn ránṣẹ́ láàárín àkókò kúkúrú kan. Dúró fún ìṣẹ́jú díẹ̀ kí o sì tún gbìyànjú — àwọn ti tẹ́lẹ̀ ti dé.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® kò lè gba rẹpọ́ọ̀tì náà ní báyìí — àṣìṣe náà wá láti ọ̀dọ̀ wa, kì í ṣe tìrẹ. Tún gbìyànjú láìpẹ́, tàbí kí o da rẹpọ́ọ̀tì tó wà lókè yẹn kọ sínú tíkẹ́ẹ̀tì kan.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'A kọ ijabọ naa (HTTP %d). Daakọ rẹ loke ki o ṣii tiketi kan, nipa sọ nọmba yẹn.','This site’s owner has turned off image uploads for Zinn Digital® in the Zinn® Connector settings.'=>'Oníwèé-àtẹ yí ti pa ìrànwọ́ ìfìwé-àwòrán sílẹ̀ fún Zinn Digital® nínú àwọn ètò Zinn® Connector.','This site’s owner has turned off edits to existing articles for Zinn Digital® in the Zinn® Connector settings.'=>'Oníwèébù yìí ti pa àtúnṣe sí àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ tó wà tẹ́lẹ̀ fún Zinn Digital® nínú àwọn ètò Zinn® Connector.','New article on your site: %s'=>'Àpilẹ̀kọ tuntun lórí ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù rẹ: %s','Zinn Digital® has added an article to your site.

Title: %1$s
Edit it: %2$s
Status: %3$s

Turn these emails off on the Zinn Digital® → Connector → Publishing screen.'=>'Zinn Digital® ti fi àpilẹ̀kọ kan kún ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù rẹ.

Àkọlé: %1$s
Ṣàtúnṣe rẹ̀: %2$s
Ipò: %3$s

Pa àwọn lẹ́tà-ẹlẹ́tirọ́ọ̀nì wọ̀nyí lórí ojú-ìbòjú Zinn Digital® → Connector → Publishing.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — àwọn ìtọ́sọ́nà àti iṣẹ́','User guides'=>'Àwọn ìtọ́sọ́nà olùlò','Read the %s user guide'=>'Ka itọsọna olumulo %s','Hide this'=>'Tọ́jú èyí','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Alejo Zinn® fun WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, àwọn àwòkọ afẹ́yìntì ojoojúmọ́, ìṣílọ ọ̀fẹ́ àti pánẹ́ẹ̀lì ìṣàkóso tí a kọ́ fún àwọn ènìyàn tí ń ṣiṣẹ́ lórí ojúlé ju ẹyọ kan lọ.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Ọjà Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Ra ati ta awọn aaye ti a ti fi idi rẹ mulẹ, awọn ibugbe ati awọn ibi gbigbe ọna asopọ, pẹlu owo ti a tọju ni aabo titi awọn ẹgbẹ mejeeji yoo fi ni itẹlọrun.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — gba àwọn ènìyàn tí iṣẹ́ yìí jẹ́ ohun ìgbésí ayé wọn síṣẹ́','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Ọjà iṣẹ́ aládàáni àgbáyé wa: wá nínú àwọn iṣẹ́ tí ó ti wà nílẹ̀ tí ó ju 10,000 lọ láti ọwọ́ àwọn olùkọ̀wé, àwọn olùṣe àwòrán, àwọn aṣèdá ètò kọ̀ǹpútà àti àwọn onímọ̀ SEO, tàbí fi iṣẹ́ ránṣẹ́ kí o sì jẹ́ kí wọ́n dúnadúrà lórí rẹ̀.','Connector'=>'Olùsopọ̀','Connection'=>'Ìsopọ̀','Publishing'=>'Ń tẹ́njáde','Backups'=>'Àwọn ẹ̀dà afipamọ́','Advanced'=>'To ti ni ilosiwaju','Check the connection now'=>'Ṣayẹwo àsopọ̀ báyìí','Disconnect this site'=>'Ge àsopọ̀ aaye yii kúrò','This revokes the credential Zinn Digital® uses, so we can no longer publish to this site. Anything already published stays. Continue?'=>'Èyí yọ ẹ̀rí ìdánimọ̀ tí Zinn Digital® ń lò kúrò, nítorí náà a kò ní lè tẹ̀wé jáde sí orí ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí mọ́. Ohun gbogbo tí a ti tẹ̀ jáde tẹ́lẹ̀ yóò wà níbẹ̀. Ṣé kí a tẹ̀síwájú?','What we may do on this site'=>'Ohun ti a le ṣe lori aaye yii','The credential we hold is an ordinary WordPress application password, so WordPress itself decides what is possible. These narrow it further, on your side.'=>'Ìwé-ẹ̀rí tí a ní jẹ́ ọ̀rọ̀-ìgbaniwọlé ohun-èlò WordPress lásán, nítorí náà WordPress fúnra rẹ̀ ló ń pinnu ohun tí ó ṣeé ṣe. Àwọn wọ̀nyí tún dín kù siwaju síi, ní ìhà tirẹ.','Publish articles as'=>'Tẹ àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ jáde gẹ́gẹ́ bí','Choose “a draft” if you would rather read everything before it goes live.'=>'Yan "àkọsílẹ̀ àkọ́kọ́" tí o bá fẹ́ ka gbogbo nǹkan kí ó tó jáde sita.','Published straight away'=>'Ṣe atẹjade lẹsẹkẹsẹ','A draft, for me to review'=>'Àkọsílẹ̀ àkọ́kọ́ kan, fún mi láti yẹ̀wò','Pending review'=>'Nduro fun ayẹwo','Scheduled, using the date we send'=>'A ṣètò rẹ̀, nípa lílo ọjọ́ tí a fi ránṣẹ́','Show the author as'=>'Ṣe afihan onkọwe bi','Which of your users appears as the author. This does not change who we sign in as.'=>'Èwo nínú àwọn olùlò rẹ ló ń hàn gẹ́gẹ́ bíi òǹkọ̀wé. Èyí kò ní yí ẹni tí a wọlé bíi rẹ̀ padà.','Put articles in'=>'Fi àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ sí','Allow images'=>'Gba awọn aworan laaye','Let Zinn Digital® upload images into this site’s media library'=>'Gba Zinn Digital® láàyè láti gbe àwọn àwòrán síbùkú ìwé àkóónú ti ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí','Turn this off and articles arrive without their images. Nothing already uploaded is removed.'=>'Pa èyí tí àwọn àpilẹ̀kọ yóò sì dé láìsí àwọn àwòrán wọn. Kò sí ohun tí a ti gbé sára ẹ̀rọ tẹ́lẹ̀ tí a ó yọ kúrò.','Allow edits'=>'Gba àtúnṣe láàyè','Let Zinn Digital® update an article it published before'=>'Gba Zinn Digital® láàyè láti ṣe àfikún sí àkọsílẹ̀ tí ó tẹ̀jáde tẹ́lẹ̀','Used for corrections and re-optimisation. It never touches anything you wrote yourself.'=>'A máa ń lò ó fún àtúnṣe àti àtúnṣe fún dídára síi. Kò kì í fọwọ́kan ohun tí ẹ kọ fúnra yín rárá.','Tell me when something is published'=>'Sọ fún mi nígbà tí a bá tẹ nǹkan kan jáde','Leave blank for no email. One message per article, from your own site.'=>'Fi sílẹ̀ ní òfo fún àìní imeeli. Ìfiránṣẹ́ kan fún àpilẹ̀kọ kọ̀ọ̀kan, láti orí ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù tirẹ̀.','Off-site backups'=>'Awọn afẹyinti ita aaye','This site sends its own backup straight to Zinn® storage. Nothing passes through our servers on the way.'=>'Aaye yii n fi ẹda afẹyinti tirẹ ranṣẹ taara si ibi ipamọ Zinn®. Ko si ohun ti o kọja nipasẹ awọn olupin wa ni ọna.','Back this site up to Zinn Digital®'=>'Ṣe afẹyinti aaye yii si Zinn Digital®','Backup token'=>'Ami ifipamọ','Paste the token shown on this site’s Backups tab in your Zinn Digital® dashboard when you chose the plugin connection. It is shown there only once; saving the connection again issues a new one.'=>'Lẹ àmì-ìdánimọ̀ tí a fihàn lórí táàbù Àwọn àwòkọ ti ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí sínú pátákó ìdarí Zinn Digital® rẹ nígbà tí o yan ìsopọ̀ àfikún náà. Ẹ̀kan ṣoṣo ni a máa ń fi hàn níbẹ̀; títọ́jú ìsopọ̀ náà lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi yóò mú tuntun jáde.','Leave these out'=>'Fi àwọn wọ̀nyí sílẹ̀','One path per line, relative to wp-content — for example <code>cache</code> or <code>uploads/backups</code>. Caches and other backup plugins’ folders are the usual candidates.'=>'Opa-ọna kan fun ila kọọkan, ni ibatan si wp-content — fun apẹẹrẹ <code>cache</code> tabi <code>uploads/backups</code>. Awọn cache ati awọn folda awọn afikun afẹyinti miiran ni awọn oludije to wọpọ.','Stop if the archive would exceed'=>'Duro ti ile-ipamọ ba kọja','Megabytes. A shared host will usually kill a very large archive part-way; a bound turns that into a message instead of a silent failure.'=>'Megabytes. Ilé-iṣẹ́ agbàlejò pínpín máa ń dá àkójọpọ̀ tó tóbi gan-an dúró ní agbedeméjì; ààlà kan yóò sọ èyí di ìránṣẹ́ dípò kí ó kùnà láìsọ̀rọ̀.','Detailed logging'=>'Gbigbasilẹ lẹkunrẹrẹ','Record what this plugin does, for support'=>'Ṣe àkọsílẹ̀ ohun tí àfikún yìí ń ṣe, fún ìrànlọ́wọ́','Kept on this site, capped at the last 50 entries, and included in a diagnostics report. Turn it on before reproducing a problem.'=>'A tọ́jú rẹ̀ sí orí aaye yii, o ni opin si awọn akọsilẹ 50 to kẹhin, a si fi kun ijabọ iwadii aisan. Tan-an ṣaaju ki o to tun iṣoro kan ṣe.','On uninstall'=>'Nígbà tí a bá yọ́ kúrò','Delete this plugin’s settings when it is uninstalled'=>'Pa àwọn ètò àfikún yìí rẹ́ nígbà tí a bá yọ ọ́ kúrò','Uninstalling never revokes the application password — that is deliberate, so uninstalling to try something else does not break your publishing. Use Disconnect above if you want the credential gone.'=>'Yiyo kuro ko ni fagilee ọrọ igbaniwọle ohun elo naa lae — iyẹn jẹ mọọmọ, ki yiyọ kuro lati gbiyanju nkan miiran ma ba ba iṣẹ titẹjade rẹ jẹ. Lo Ge asopọ loke ti o ba fẹ ki eri idanimọ naa parẹ.','The user we sign in as'=>'Olùlò tí a wọlé gẹ́gẹ́ bí','The site’s default category'=>'Ẹ̀ka àtìbẹ̀rẹ̀ ti ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù','Connect this site again'=>'So ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí pọ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi','Connect this site'=>'So ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí pọ̀','Open your Zinn Digital® dashboard, go to Content → Other sites, and press “Get a pairing code”. Paste it below.'=>'Ṣí pátákó ìṣàkóso Zinn Digital® rẹ, lọ sí Àkóónú → Àwọn ojúlé mìíràn, kí o sì tẹ “Gba kóòdù ìsopọ̀”. Lẹ mọ́ ìsàlẹ̀.','Connecting again creates a fresh credential and leaves the old one in place — use Disconnect first if you want the old one gone.'=>'Sísopọ̀ mọ́ ọn lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i yóò ṣẹ̀dá ẹ̀rí ìdánimọ̀ tuntun kan tí yóò sì fi èyí àtijọ́ sílẹ̀ — kọ́kọ́ lo Yọ ìsopọ̀ kúrò tí o bá fẹ́ kí a mú èyí àtijọ́ kúrò.','Pairing code'=>'Kóòdù ìsopọ̀','It expires thirty minutes after you generate it, and can only be used once.'=>'Yoo parí lẹ́yìn ọgbọ̀n ìṣẹ́jú tí ẹ bá ti ṣẹ̀dá rẹ̀, ẹ̀ẹ̀kan pṣoṣo sì ni a lè lò ó.','You are not allowed to connect this site.'=>'A ko gba ọ laaye lati so aaye ayelujara yii pọ.','This site is not connected to Zinn Digital®.'=>'Aaye yii ko ni asopọ mọ Zinn Digital®.','Nothing is wrong — it has simply not been paired yet. Get a pairing code from your Zinn® dashboard and paste it into this plugin’s settings.'=>'Kò sí ohun tó bàjẹ́ — a kàn kò tíì so pọ̀ ni. Gba kóòdù ìsopọ̀ láti orí pẹpẹ ìṣàkóso Zinn® rẹ kí o sì lẹ̀ ẹ́ sínú àwọn ètò àfikún yìí.','Open my Zinn® dashboard'=>'Ṣí pátákó ìṣàkóso Zinn® mi','The connection is broken.'=>'Asopọ naa ti bajẹ.','The WordPress user the credential belonged to (%s) no longer exists on this site, so nothing we send can be published. Connect again as a user who can publish.'=>'Olùlò WordPress tí ẹ̀rí ìdánimọ̀ náà jẹ́ ti rẹ̀ (%s) kò sí lórí ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí mọ́, nítorí náà kò sí ohun tí a fi ránṣẹ́ tí a lè tẹ̀jáde. Tún bẹ̀rẹ̀ ìsopọ̀ gẹ́gẹ́ bí olùlò tí ó lè tẹ̀wé jáde.','The “Zinn Digital® (publishing)” application password has been deleted from this site, so we can no longer sign in. Connect again to create a new one — nothing else was lost.'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ìgbannọ́ àfilọ́lẹ̀ “Zinn Digital® (publishing)” ti di píparẹ́ kúrò lórí ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí, nítorí náà a kò lè wọlé mọ́. Tún sopọ̀ láti ṣẹ̀dá tuntun kan — kò sí ohun mìíràn tí ó sọnù.','See this site’s application passwords'=>'Wo àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ìgbaniwọlé ìfilọ́lẹ̀ ti ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí','Connected, but publishing would fail.'=>'Ti sopọ, ṣùgbọ́n títẹ̀jáde yóò kùnà.','The credential belongs to %s, and that user can no longer publish posts. Sign-in still works, so nothing looks wrong until an article is due. Give that user the ability to publish, or connect again as somebody who can.'=>'Ìwé-ẹ̀rí náà jẹ́ ti %s, olùlò yẹn kò sì lè tẹ àwọn àtẹ̀jáde jáde mọ́. Ìwọlé ṣì ń ṣiṣẹ́, nítorí náà kò sí ohun tí ó dà bí èyí tí kò tọ́ títí di ìgbà tí àkókò àkọsílẹ̀ kan yóò fi pé. Fún olùlò yẹn ní agbára láti tẹ̀wé jáde, tàbí kí o tún sopọ̀ gẹ́gẹ́ bí ẹnì kan tí ó lè ṣe bẹ́ẹ̀.','Edit that user'=>'Ṣàtúnṣe olùlò yẹn','Connected here — we could not reach Zinn Digital® to confirm.'=>'Ti sopọ nihin-in — a ko le kan si Zinn Digital® lati jẹrisi.','Connected, but your Zinn® account needs attention.'=>'Ti sopọ, ṣugbọn àkọọlẹ Zinn® rẹ nilo akiyesi.','Connected to Zinn Digital®.'=>'Ti sopọ mọ Zinn Digital®.','Connected to Zinn Digital® as %s.'=>'Ti sopọ mọ́ Zinn Digital® gẹ́gẹ́ bí %s.','Publishing as'=>'Ń tẹ̀jáde bíi','Zinn® site ID'=>'ID ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù Zinn®','This server could not reach api.zinndigital.com (%s). That is usually a firewall or an outbound-connection rule on your host, not a problem with your Zinn® account — publishing may still be working.'=>'Olùpèsè yìí kò lè dé ọ̀dọ̀ api.zinndigital.com (%s). Ìyẹn sábà máa ń jẹ́ nítorí ààbò iná (firewall) tàbí òfin ìsopọ̀ àti-jáde lórí agbàlejò yín, kì í ṣe ìṣòro pẹ̀lú àkọọ́lẹ̀ Zinn® yín — ìtẹ̀jáde lè ṣì máa ṣiṣẹ́ lọ́wọ́.','Zinn Digital® answered with an error of its own — that is our end, not yours. Publishing is unaffected while this clears.'=>'Zinn Digital® dáhùn pẹ̀lú àṣìṣe ti ara rẹ̀ — tiwa ni, kì í ṣe tiyín. Títẹ̀jáde kò ní ní ìpalára bí a ṣe ń yanjú èyí lọ́wọ́.','Your Zinn® account is not currently able to publish to this site. Your dashboard says why.'=>'Àkọọ́lẹ̀ Zinn® rẹ kò lè tẹ̀jáde sí orí ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́. Pẹpẹ ìṣàkóso rẹ sọ ìdí rẹ̀.','Zinn Digital® answered HTTP %d, which we do not recognise. Send a diagnostics report from the Support tab and we will look — do not change anything here first.'=>'Zinn Digital® dáhùn pẹlu HTTP %d, èyí tí a kò mọ̀. Fi ìjábọ̀ àyẹ̀wò ránṣẹ́ láti inú táàbù Ìtìlẹ́yìn kí a sì lè yẹ̀ ẹ́ wò — ẹ má ṣe yí ohunkóhun padà níhìn-ín tẹ́lẹ̀.','Check again now'=>'Ṣayẹwo lẹẹkansi ni bayi','Checked. The connection is live.'=>'A ti yẹ ẹ́ wò. Ìsopọ̀ náà ń ṣiṣẹ́ lọ́wọ́.','We could not remove the application password, so this site is still connected. Delete “Zinn Digital® (publishing)” on your profile screen and try again — we have changed nothing.'=>'A kò le yọ ọ̀rọ̀ìgbaniwọlé ìṣàfilọ́lẹ̀ náà kúrò, nítorí náà ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí ṣì wà ní sísopọ̀. Pa “Zinn Digital® (publishing)” rẹ́ lórí ojú-ìbòjú ìwé-ìtàn rẹ kí o sì tún gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i — a kò yí ohunkóhun padà.','Disconnected. The application password has been revoked, so Zinn Digital® can no longer publish to this site. Nothing already published was touched.'=>'Ti ge asopọ kuro. A ti fagilee ọrọ igbaniwọle ohun elo naa, nitorinaa Zinn Digital® ko le ṣe atẹjade si aaye yii mọ. Ko si ohun kankan ti a ti tẹjade tẹlẹ ti a fi ọwọ kan.','That file could not be read from this server, so nothing was uploaded.'=>'A kò lè ka fáìlì yẹn láti orí ẹ̀rọ-ìpèsè yìí, nítorí náà a kò gbé ohunkóhun sókè.','This site could not stream the upload, so nothing was sent.'=>'Aaye yii ko le san gbigbepọ sita, nitorinaa a ko fi nkan kankan ranṣẹ.','This file is %1$s and this site\'s PHP has no cURL, so the largest it can upload is %2$s.'=>'Fáìlì yìí jẹ́ %1$s bẹ́ẹ̀ sì ni PHP ti ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí kò ní cURL, nítorí náà èyí tí ó tóbi jùlọ tí ó lè gbé sókè jẹ́ %2$s.','The upload could not be completed.'=>'A ko le pari fifi-soke naa.','Storage refused the upload (HTTP %d).'=>'Ibùdó-ìpamọ́ kọ ìrùsókè náà (HTTP %d).','Style preset'=>'Ètò àkànṣe àṣà','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Ojú-ìwé ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ kan. Ohunkóhun tí ó wà ní ìsàlẹ̀ ń tẹ̀ ẹ́ mọ́lẹ̀.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Lo àwọn àwọ̀ àti ìwọ̀n tièmi fúnra mi','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Fi èyí sílẹ̀ ní pípa kí a sì lo àtòtẹ́lẹ̀ náà gẹ́gẹ́ bí ó ṣe wà gan-an.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Wo àwọn àkíyèsí ìtúsílẹ̀ Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Iṣẹ́ ìṣàgbéga Zinn® kò pèsè ọ̀nà ìgbàsílẹ̀ fún ìṣàgbéga yìí. Ṣàyẹ̀wò bóyá ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí lè ráyè sí pẹpẹ Zinn®, lẹ́yìn náà kí ẹ tún gbìyànjú.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'A kò le ṣe igbasilẹ imudojuiwọn naa lati iṣẹ imudojuiwọn Zinn® (%s). Gbiyanju lẹẹkansi ni iṣẹju diẹ.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Ìmúdójúìwọ̀n tí a gbàsílẹ̀ kùnà ìyẹ̀wò títọ́ rẹ̀, a kò sì fi sípò.']];